{"timestamp":1774801283397,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"0988d8b4-3e03-455c-a159-83c4fcb90053","hook_event_type":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_011pWyH7YgzKGnoP54f44SXd","payload":{"session_id":"0988d8b4-3e03-455c-a159-83c4fcb90053","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-harness-apps-mas-trees-pw-69eb6d14/0988d8b4-3e03-455c-a159-83c4fcb90053.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-harness/apps/mas/trees/pw-69eb6d14","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-harness/apps/mas/trees/pw-69eb6d14/specs/issue-8-adw-a1b2c3d4-sdlc_planner-gitignore-pinata.md","content":"# Plan: Add .pinata/ to .gitignore\n\n## Summary\nAdd .pinata/ runtime directories to .gitignore to prevent accidental commits of workflow artifacts generated by the pinata workflows engine.\n\n## Task Description\nAdd specific .pinata/ directories to the .gitignore file to prevent runtime artifacts from being accidentally committed while preserving committed subdirs like specs/ and docs/.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `.gitignore` - main gitignore file where pinata entries need to be added\n\n## Step by Step Tasks\n\n### 1. Update .gitignore with pinata entries\n- Add `.pinata/logs/` entry to ignore log directories\n- Add `.pinata/reports/` entry to ignore report directories\n- Add `.pinata/agents/` entry to ignore agent runtime data\n- Add `.pinata/ports.env` entry to ignore port configuration\n- Add `.pinata/stack.json` entry to ignore stack configuration\n- Group these entries under a comment section like \"# Pinata workflow artifacts\"\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- All specified .pinata/ entries are added to .gitignore\n- Entries are properly grouped and commented for clarity\n- Existing .gitignore entries remain unchanged\n- Runtime .pinata/ artifacts are ignored while committed subdirs remain tracked\n\n## Validation Commands\n- `git status` to verify .pinata/ files are ignored if present\n- `git check-ignore .pinata/logs/test.log` to verify ignore pattern works"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_011pWyH7YgzKGnoP54f44SXd"}}
